        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "inlines": [
            {
              "t": "Pricing and subscription"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            {
              "depth": 0,
              "inlines": [
                {
                  "href": "https://www.comfy.org/cloud/pricing",
                  "b": true,
                  "t": "Check pricing"
                },
                {
                  "t": " — View pricing and subscription options for Comfy Cloud"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "inlines": [
            {
              "t": "How to use ComfyUI Cloud"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "t": "Using ComfyUI Cloud is essentially the same as using your local ComfyUI. If this is your first time using ComfyUI, here are some quick tips to get started:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 4,
          "inlines": [
            {
              "t": "Select a template"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "t": "Click the template icon in the left sidebar to browse available workflows."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/tutorial-media/rent-gpu-comfyui/md-c03c30436084.webp",
          "width": 1600,
          "height": 881,
          "alt": "Open workflow template"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 4,
          "inlines": [
            {
              "t": "Select the workflow you want to run"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "t": "Click on the template you want to run."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/tutorial-media/rent-gpu-comfyui/md-96db8547ecd5.webp",
          "width": 1600,
          "height": 888,
          "alt": "Select workflow template"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 4,
          "inlines": [
            {
              "t": "Update template inputs"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": true,
          "items": [
            {
              "depth": 0,
              "inlines": [
                {
                  "t": "In the loaded workflow, since we have pre-installed all models in the cloud version, all templates are ready to run immediately after loading."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "depth": 0,
              "inlines": [
                {
                  "t": "If you need to make updates, you only need to provide image inputs or text prompts. Check the "
                },
                {
                  "c": true,
                  "t": "Load Image"
                },
                {
                  "t": " node or "
                },
                {
                  "c": true,
                  "t": "CLIP Text Encode"
                },
                {
                  "t": " node."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/tutorial-media/rent-gpu-comfyui/md-2a8515ec8318.webp",
          "width": 1600,
          "height": 881,
          "alt": "Check inputs"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 4,
          "inlines": [
            {
              "t": "Run your workflow"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "t": "If everything is correct, click the \"Run\" icon or use the shortcut \"Ctrl + Enter\" to run the workflow."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/tutorial-media/rent-gpu-comfyui/md-40f7c527b614.webp",
          "width": 1600,
          "height": 1126,
          "alt": "Run workflow"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 4,
          "inlines": [
            {
              "t": "View output"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "t": "After clicking run, our service will start allocating a machine for your workflow. You can check the execution status of the corresponding workflow in the queue panel."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/tutorial-media/rent-gpu-comfyui/md-28476230faca.webp",
          "width": 1600,
          "height": 1100,
          "alt": "View queue"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 4,
          "inlines": [
            {
              "t": "Save content locally"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "t": "After the workflow execution is complete, you can save the generated content locally. Depending on the asset type, the save method is as follows:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "b": true,
              "t": "Save images"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "t": "In the queue panel or on the save image node, right-click on the generated image and select \"Save image\" to save the image locally."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/tutorial-media/rent-gpu-comfyui/md-1ae475f7c809.webp",
          "width": 1600,
          "height": 770,
          "alt": "Save image assets"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "b": true,
              "t": "Save videos"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "t": "In the queue panel or on the save video node:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": true,
          "items": [
            {
              "depth": 0,
              "inlines": [
                {
                  "t": "Click the three dots on the browser player component to open the menu"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "depth": 0,
              "inlines": [
                {
                  "t": "Select \"Download\" to save the video locally."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/tutorial-media/rent-gpu-comfyui/md-8fbeb57dee82.webp",
          "width": 1600,
          "height": 869,
          "alt": "Save video assets"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "b": true,
              "t": "Save audio"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "t": "In the queue panel or on the save audio node:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": true,
          "items": [
            {
              "depth": 0,
              "inlines": [
                {
                  "t": "Click the three dots on the browser player component to open the menu"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "depth": 0,
              "inlines": [
                {
                  "t": "Select \"Download\" to save the audio file locally."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/tutorial-media/rent-gpu-comfyui/md-aec71a8f0fdb.webp",
          "width": 1600,
          "height": 866,
          "alt": "Save audio assets"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "b": true,
              "t": "Save 3D assets"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "t": "In the 3D browser node menu, select the \"Export\" option, choose the format you want to save, and the 3D file will be saved locally."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/tutorial-media/rent-gpu-comfyui/md-d948579b2002.webp",
          "width": 1600,
          "height": 1003,
          "alt": "Save 3D assets"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "inlines": [
            {
              "t": "Feedback"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "t": "If you have any thoughts, suggestions, or run into any issues, simply click the \"Feedback\" icon. This will directly send your feedback to us."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/tutorial-media/rent-gpu-comfyui/md-514f4d3acf61.webp",
          "width": 1600,
          "height": 1163,
          "alt": "Feedback"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 4,
          "inlines": [
            {
              "t": "How to Stop/Exit Comfy Cloud"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "t": "Cloud sessions only bill you while the GPU is actively running. When you close the browser tab, the session stops automatically — you can close it anytime, just like a regular browser tab."
            }
          ]
        },
